
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5038

### Missing ingestion key — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectSlug": "physical-sciences",
  "grade": 12,
  "topicSlug": "newtonian-mechanics",
  "examYear": 2022,
  "examSeason": "May-June",
  "paperNumber": 1,
  "questionNumber": "test",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "questionImageUrl": "https://example.com/question.webp",
  "memoImageUrl": "https://example.com/memo.webp"
}

### Invalid ingestion key — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questions
Content-Type: application/json
